      <description align="center" color="yellow" colored="false" height="249" resized="true" width="470" x="31" y="239">02_Trigger_main:&lt;br&gt;It is just a wrapper around 03_Trigger_Service. it receives 'case_id' from 01_Master_process and passes the same to '03_Trigger_Service'.&lt;br&gt;Advantage of this wrapper are:&lt;br&gt;1. it is small in size. Therefore, limits the log size created on AIhub once this is triggered for all the cases every hour .&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 01_Master_process usage encoded code to trigger the cases. Since, this process does not change unlike '03_Trigger_Service'. It is ideal to encode this process to avoid frequent updation of encoded code in '01_master_process'.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
